{"id":"664464","name":"上汤苋菜","author":"圆小π","authorId":"1365842","desc":"","cover":"images/664464/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红苋菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"皮蛋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"火腿肠","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"苋菜摘去老杆，冲洗干净。","img":"images/664464/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"皮蛋，火腿切丁，姜切片，蒜切大块备用。","img":"images/664464/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"烧开水，下入苋菜烫熟。","img":"images/664464/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出来控干。","img":"images/664464/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅内倒油烧至六成热，下入姜蒜爆香。","img":"images/664464/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"下入皮蛋，火腿翻炒一会儿。","img":"images/664464/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入水或高汤煮开。","img":"images/664464/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量盐，松茸鲜调味提鲜。","img":"images/664464/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入烫熟的苋菜，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/664464/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/664464/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"鲜香上汤苋菜。","img":"images/664464/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}